---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';

export const prerender = true;
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Booking Terms"
  description="Cancellation, payment and house terms for direct bookings at Remarkable BnB in Hanley's Farm, Queenstown."
>
  <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 py-12 sm:py-16">
    <div class="mb-12">
      <span class="badge badge-ember mb-3">Booking terms</span>
      <h1 class="text-4xl sm:text-5xl font-medium mb-4">Direct booking terms</h1>
      <p class="text-[var(--color-stone-grey)] max-w-xl">
        The plain-language terms for booking direct with us. If anything here is unclear, just ask when you enquire.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="space-y-10">
      <section>
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-medium mb-3">Cancellations and changes</h2>
        <p class="text-sm text-[var(--color-stone-grey)] leading-relaxed mb-3">
          We mirror our Airbnb cancellation policy for direct bookings, Moderate:
        </p>
        <ul class="list-disc pl-5 space-y-1.5 text-sm text-[var(--color-stone-grey)] leading-relaxed mb-3 marker:text-[var(--color-ember)]">
          <li>Full refund if you cancel at least 5 days before check-in.</li>
          <li>Partial refund if you cancel less than 5 days before check-in.</li>
          <li>If you cancel within 5 days of check-in, or during your trip, you're charged for 1 extra night and refunded 50% of the unspent nights.</li>
        </ul>
        <p class="text-sm text-[var(--color-stone-grey)] leading-relaxed mb-3">
          The cleaning fee is always refunded on cancellation, regardless of timing.
        </p>
        <p class="text-sm text-[var(--color-stone-grey)] leading-relaxed">
          We do try to be reasonable. If we can rebook your cancelled dates, we'll refund the nights we rebook.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-medium mb-3">Payment</h2>
        <p class="text-sm text-[var(--color-stone-grey)] leading-relaxed">
          Payment in full is required to confirm your booking. We'll send a secure payment link when we reply to your enquiry with your dates and total.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-medium mb-3">Check-in and check-out</h2>
        <p class="text-sm text-[var(--color-stone-grey)] leading-relaxed">
          Check-in from 3:00pm, check-out by 10:00am. Early check-in and bag drop are often possible, just ask.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-medium mb-3">Smoking and parties</h2>
        <p class="text-sm text-[var(--color-stone-grey)] leading-relaxed">
          No smoking inside the house or unit, there's outdoor space if you need it. No parties or events, we live here and our neighbours are close.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-medium mb-3">Hot tub</h2>
        <p class="text-sm text-[var(--color-stone-grey)] leading-relaxed">
          The wood-fired hot tub is a paid add-on, not a standard amenity. We heat it to order, so pricing and availability depend on the day, ask us when you enquire. Up to 4 people, swimwear required, please shower before use.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-medium mb-3">Pets</h2>
        <p class="text-sm text-[var(--color-stone-grey)] leading-relaxed mb-3">
          Two Bedroom Unit: well-behaved medium and large dogs are welcome by arrangement, the unit has a fenced outdoor space and we can provide a crate if needed. Small dogs might fit through the fence, so please ask before booking.
        </p>
        <p class="text-xs text-[var(--color-sun-gold-dark)] font-semibold">
          TODO, hosts to confirm: pet policy for the Guest Room, where Rocket and Luna already live.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-medium mb-3">Children and the guest limit</h2>
        <p class="text-xs text-[var(--color-sun-gold-dark)] font-semibold">
          TODO, hosts to confirm: whether children count toward the maximum guest number for each stay.
        </p>
      </section>
    </div>

    <div class="mt-12 pt-8 border-t border-[var(--color-hairline)]">
      <p class="text-sm text-[var(--color-stone-grey)]">
        Questions about any of this? <a href="/contact" class="text-[var(--color-ember)] font-semibold hover:underline">Get in touch</a> before you book.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
